1514.description:
Graviteam Studios specializes in developing various wargames, including tactical games and tank simulators. In 2011, they released Graviteam Tactics: Operation Star, and later added many interesting expansions. However, the time has come to continue the Graviteam Tactics series — on March 5th, the next installment was released, titled Mius-Front, a reference to the Mius River, which flows through Russia and Ukraine. Graviteam Tactics: Mius-Front Proposes four large-scale operations (two for the USSR and two for Germany) that unfolded in the summer of 1943 on the Mius River and the Saur-Mogila burial mound. The total battlefield area was 140 square kilometers.

Gameplay Graviteam Tactics: Mius-Front
Graviteam's new project features two modes: operational and tactical. The former is turn-based and designed for troop mobilization, reinforcement, and equipment maintenance. The latter is designed for direct combat, taking place in real time. Here, naturally, you'll be destroying enemy infantry and equipment and capturing territory.

Features Graviteam Tactics: Mius-Front
Some gamers decide to download a torrent Graviteam Tactics: Mius-Front, as this tactical game offers over 100 types of military equipment, created in factories in the USSR, Germany, Great Britain, and the USA. Others are drawn to the detailed realism of the recreated terrain, for which the developers used various video and photographic materials, as well as topographic maps. What attracts Graviteam Tactics: Mius-Front also has a built-in encyclopedia that allows you to study military equipment in detail.
The new tactical game from Graviteam also features:
- updated interface with various design options;
- advanced artificial intelligence focused on gamer behavior;
- the ability to examine the statistics of a battle - the number of losses, damage, etc.;
- the presence of various devices and conditions for simulating the next battle;
- the actual behavior of the troops, based on the experience, morale and endurance of each soldier;
- detailed flight trajectories of projectiles and bullets, which are influenced by external conditions;
- advanced damage system - individual parts of the equipment may fail;
- a well-thought-out system of destruction that covers the entire environment.

